flowchart LR
  R[Operator] --> N[Loopback Nginx gateway]
  N --> S[Stateless commerce services]
  S --> P[(Single local PostgreSQL)]
  S --> K[(Single local Kafka)]
  P --> B[Per-database custom dumps + SHA-256]
