  D --> X[Isolated disposable restore project]
  X --> V[Schema/table/readability verification]
  S --> H[Health exporter]
  P --> H
  K --> H
  H --> M[Prometheus]
  M --> G[Grafana service health dashboard]
  L[Helm replicas/resources] -. larger hosts .-> S
